#{[{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119807 :knowledge-point/canonical-example {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186119618 :knowledge-point/_canonical-example [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/id #uuid "13ebde04-8518-5837-9420-c9487debc562" :question/math-academy-id "e-4791" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n![](images/0b/0b7919416954fe536a93f681fb3c56cac8dddff67e389ef233fdb242390dfb91.svg)\n\nIf $x_1 \\mathbf{c}_1 + x_2\\mathbf{c}_2  = \\mathbf d,$ then what is $x_1+x_2?$" :question/worked-solution "If $x_1 \\mathbf{c}_1 + x_2\\mathbf{c}_2  = \\mathbf d,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -5 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=5 \\\\ -{x}_{1} &=-5 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=0\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the second equation, we obtain $x_1=5,$ which we substitute into the first equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} & =5 \\\\ 4(5)+{x}_{2} & =5 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =-15.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute $x_1=5$ and $x_2=-15$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} & =0 \\\\ 3(5)+(-15) & =0 \\\\ 0 & =0,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is $x_1=5$ and $x_2=-15,$ which means\n\n$$\n5 \\mathbf{c_1}-15 \\mathbf{c_2} = \\mathbf{d}.\n$$\n\nConsequently,\n\n$$\nx_1+x_2=5-15=-10.\n$$"} :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/key-prerequisites [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186048826}] :knowledge-point/questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120293 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "d6d66bec-4f70-53d2-9ff4-2520b4c8cdf2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117898} {:answer/id #uuid "f4d4957d-eb5a-5c29-b427-cd7789e9a7a3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117899} {:answer/id #uuid "2eb48522-7684-5c49-9b22-80599f5f6575" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117900} {:answer/id #uuid "55c5a60b-30f3-5dd0-8c86-12e610e70a02" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117901} {:answer/id #uuid "5f15135e-67c9-596b-bf5d-2210d31c2fb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117902}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d6d66bec-4f70-53d2-9ff4-2520b4c8cdf2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117898} :answer-field/id #uuid "eb5fae5b-0364-5098-baba-4caac87e9d00" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186117897}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "b9323edd-e697-569c-8dd2-3fe5f9eed059" :question/math-academy-id "q-34054" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=5 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{2} &=2\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nFrom the third equation we get ${x}_{2}=2$, which we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} & =3 \\\\ -{x}_{1}+2 & =3 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} & =5 \\\\ -(-1)+2(2) & =5 \\\\ 5 & =5,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=2,$ which means\n\n$$\n-{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-1+2=1.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186120350 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0e17edfa-489a-532b-8331-c10b33d49743" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317615} {:answer/id #uuid "5371c3dc-73f8-545d-9df1-de385114de69" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317844} {:answer/id #uuid "670bbcb4-135b-58eb-8e13-6d202b4e1780" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317918} {:answer/id #uuid "7c5fdb3b-3dae-5b2c-9ba8-0af1f1050a3d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317982} {:answer/id #uuid "91940bba-4486-5ef4-aa49-13aaef5d02e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318061}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7c5fdb3b-3dae-5b2c-9ba8-0af1f1050a3d" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317982} :answer-field/id #uuid "30d08b0e-d290-5821-816b-53681a92740c" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186318524}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "14248ec5-b54c-565b-8b43-275a9e097f62" :question/math-academy-id "q-34568" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,d=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=4 \\\\ 5{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the first equation by $3$ and adding the result to the second equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}13{x}_{2} & =13\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=1$ into the first equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}_{1}+4(1) & =3\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting ${x}_{1}=1$ and ${x}_{2}=1$ into the third equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} & =5 \\\\ 5(1)+2(1) & =5 \\\\ 7 & =5,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement. \n\nSo, the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240990 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "222862ae-7c2b-5d66-9d9a-f59640c9801e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238354} {:answer/id #uuid "346bdb71-8966-5ed4-ab2e-83d1ea69e239" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238507} {:answer/id #uuid "4072326e-9528-5390-aaaa-546988c57563" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238613} {:answer/id #uuid "4f101a20-f607-5e7e-b164-71aebdad2935" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238733} {:answer/id #uuid "61153d6d-bad7-5e46-a284-cae191fc9a25" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238908}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "346bdb71-8966-5ed4-ab2e-83d1ea69e239" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238507} :answer-field/id #uuid "47a0ee5a-75fc-5e2b-8002-cf62c42bfe1d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240456}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "a4963b43-3177-544a-ab68-1ea699a13395" :question/math-academy-id "q-105166" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 5\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -2{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=-3 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} &=-4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the first equation by $2$ and adding the resulting equations, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{2} & =-5,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}-3(-5) & =1 \\\\ -2{x}_{1} & =-14 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =7.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=7$ and ${x}_{2}=-5$ into the third equation and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=-4 \\\\ 3(7)+5(-5) & =-4 \\\\ -4 & =-4,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=7$ and ${x}_{2}=-5,$ which means\n\n$$\n7{a}_{1}-5{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=7+(-5)=2.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240991 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "05c3a1ce-60e5-59ff-a50a-13acd330b03f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238128} {:answer/id #uuid "16ccfa6d-4cbd-58be-a3d1-40e500abddf3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238250} {:answer/id #uuid "489d3697-4f9a-5294-985c-5ec2c27fe312" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238688} {:answer/id #uuid "51497961-e6a7-5e4d-9d38-e1cc46624ffe" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238757} {:answer/id #uuid "bb3b3d4a-ea4e-52ba-aaca-a3a81abdfca7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239685}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bb3b3d4a-ea4e-52ba-aaca-a3a81abdfca7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239685} :answer-field/id #uuid "418087c6-543a-58e8-a946-98e11e2f5b50" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240444}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "d5149dd7-ead1-5d7c-a754-e514e2e6e606" :question/math-academy-id "q-105167" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ 5 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ -3{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-7{x}_{2} \\\\ 5{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-7{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-9 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-7{x}_{2} &=-9 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equations we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{2} & =-6 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-3{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2}=3 \\\\ -3{x}_{1}+5(3) & =3 \\\\ -3{x}_{1} & =-12 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=4$ and ${x}_{2}=3$ into the third equation and obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}=1 \\\\ (4)-(3) & =1 \\\\ 1 & =1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=4$ and ${x}_{2}=3,$ which means\n\n$$\n4{a}_{1}+3{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=4+3=7.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186317259 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "12b2fa0c-2460-5194-a41e-65210aaf675c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315229} {:answer/id #uuid "2d891e0d-7387-5fcc-8ea8-042f1f7dd10c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315384} {:answer/id #uuid "2f2e1fe7-1207-5eb3-84b2-aaed65147761" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315386} {:answer/id #uuid "70266867-8c0a-5fdb-8194-68cd47f75152" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315749} {:answer/id #uuid "92550deb-3f5e-5d93-8785-214a7b0242bc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315936}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2d891e0d-7387-5fcc-8ea8-042f1f7dd10c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186315384} :answer-field/id #uuid "fda88ab2-6a42-5e3d-a747-d9d379dda047" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186317151}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "8179ffc2-2381-5ec9-a386-111d6e4cae85" :question/math-academy-id "q-34242" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,d=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1} \\\\ {x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ 5 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}0 &=4 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=5 \\\\ {x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=1\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nThe first equation is a false statement. Hence,the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342116 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "19d8ca8c-8922-5497-b29f-07f42b1c0328" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339356} {:answer/id #uuid "225a0463-cbb8-5790-893a-13e777295f9f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339423} {:answer/id #uuid "5a2860ef-3991-5816-8783-30dbaa549960" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339948} {:answer/id #uuid "88e4363d-a9d9-5e7c-8f3b-9118648894cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340350} {:answer/id #uuid "a3b0b254-d5ee-58ae-b3cb-ddf74a08a8e5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340612}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5a2860ef-3991-5816-8783-30dbaa549960" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339948} :answer-field/id #uuid "80a50f39-711b-58a4-835e-c4efbd2ce316" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341606}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "0008ebd1-cf28-5d38-a9cd-5c6dde0f95a6" :question/math-academy-id "q-73951" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{c}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{c}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix},\\,d=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$\n." :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{c}_{1}+{x}_{2}{c}_{2}=d,$ then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}2{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ {x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -11 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} &=3 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-11 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+{x}_{2} &=-5\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the second and the third  equations we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}8{x}_{1} & =-16\\,⟹\\,{x}_{1}=-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{1}=-2$ into the third equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4(-2)+{x}_{2}=-5\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting ${x}_{1}=-2$ and ${x}_{2}=3$ into the first equation, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}+2{x}_{2} & =3 \\\\ (-2)+2(3) & =3 \\\\ 4 & =3,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a false statement. \n\nSo, the system has no solution."} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342117 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "32d443f5-4a4c-51aa-af01-414ca3fa7326" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339577} {:answer/id #uuid "7176331f-77ce-5fd1-a3ac-5da0c1e2a04b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340136} {:answer/id #uuid "8b60455d-0f91-5c1b-b1a2-179e00d5ba83" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340376} {:answer/id #uuid "c1c850a2-343b-5521-9ce1-8a561961b355" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340853} {:answer/id #uuid "f64a326f-5394-5da4-88ca-9fe93d38d48b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341305}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "32d443f5-4a4c-51aa-af01-414ca3fa7326" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339577} :answer-field/id #uuid "d05bc05c-9d23-5ddd-9cf1-1346736f76da" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341745}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "eec4fe83-c254-5d51-9484-b88391578898" :question/math-academy-id "q-73952" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1} \\\\ -{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-7 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 6\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-7 \\\\ -{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=6\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the first and the second equation we get\n\n$$\n-2{x}_{2}=-8\\,⟹\\,{x}_{2}=4.\n$$\n\nSubstituting ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation yields\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} & =-7 \\\\ {x}_{1}-(4) & =-7 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-7+4 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =6 \\\\ 2(-3)+3(4) & =6 \\\\ 6 & =6,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=4,$ which means\n\n$$\n-3{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-3+4=1.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342118 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fc79319-1174-5e30-8921-c2ddee82bff8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339273} {:answer/id #uuid "9fc2f746-79cb-5fe6-bb3f-959e15f530f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340573} {:answer/id #uuid "a4526df4-3faf-51d1-bf8d-80803e953d0f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340621} {:answer/id #uuid "a8889610-4b78-5044-ae29-aded8c4e08c7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340661} {:answer/id #uuid "d2e743ee-717a-5ee8-8be6-6df96ac57d49" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340995}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9fc2f746-79cb-5fe6-bb3f-959e15f530f9" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-1" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340573} :answer-field/id #uuid "c7acad01-3471-5823-b302-ef28c20fd009" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341731}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "abf235b3-2d59-5bfb-aea0-aa237461f6b8" :question/math-academy-id "q-73954" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ 4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}5{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}16 \\\\ -1 \\\\ -18\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+5{x}_{2} &=16 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} &=-1 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-18\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the first equation by $3$, the second equation by $2$, and adding the resulting equations, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}15{x}_{2}+8{x}_{2} & =48-2 \\\\ 23{x}_{2} & =46 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we substitute ${x}_{2}=2$  into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}+4{x}_{2} & =-1\\text{ } \\\\ 3{x}_{1}+4(2) & =-1 \\\\ 3{x}_{1} & =-9 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=2$ into our third equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} & =-18 \\\\ 4(-3)-3(2) & =-18 \\\\ -18 & =-18,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo, the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-3$ and ${x}_{2}=2,$ which means\n\n$$\n-3{a}_{1}+2{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=(-3)+2=-1.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186342123 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "048486de-b3f4-54ba-a863-5232060fd28e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339161} {:answer/id #uuid "406e545a-e1be-5e50-b001-b5d9d22a4ae7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339703} {:answer/id #uuid "539b7b89-22e9-5a4e-a30d-834d8a0b99b4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339901} {:answer/id #uuid "a655e234-7164-552b-bfae-a666a8e2d4fa" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186340636} {:answer/id #uuid "f849fe1b-7f5b-56c4-97c6-1197c183e254" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341324}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "406e545a-e1be-5e50-b001-b5d9d22a4ae7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186339703} :answer-field/id #uuid "8bab3e91-55b1-56d2-8600-44d3dfd27b96" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186341626}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "3c67076c-502b-504a-869c-d6e3549e0a05" :question/math-academy-id "q-73981" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{1} \\\\ -2{x}_{1} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ -{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 \\\\ 9 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=7 \\\\ -2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=9 \\\\ 3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} &=4\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nMultiplying the third equation by $-1$ and adding the result to the first equation we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}-3{x}_{1} & =7-4 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =3.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow,  we substitute ${x}_{1}=3$ into the third equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-{x}_{2} & =4 \\\\ 3(3)-{x}_{2} & =4 \\\\ -{x}_{2} & =4-9 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=3$ and ${x}_{2}=5$ into the second equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =9 \\\\ -2(3)+3(5) & =9 \\\\ -6+15 & =9,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=3$ and ${x}_{2}=5,$ which means\n\n$$\n3{a}_{1}+5{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=3+5=8.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186435825 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "92e5e826-3121-500a-9103-e618cb16c5b2" :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0fdd8247-3e99-5680-9837-f81ce2e4daa8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435812} {:answer/id #uuid "6588aecf-5be8-5075-92ab-05e2c0bd205f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "No solution" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435816} {:answer/id #uuid "877b327c-7099-5b51-a1a0-e54f12c801d5" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435818} {:answer/id #uuid "9a314fbe-bce0-5c72-becd-d86fdd89cb4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435819} {:answer/id #uuid "b6573507-37c6-5328-ab6e-7644606e55a7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435821}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "9a314fbe-bce0-5c72-becd-d86fdd89cb4c" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435819} :answer-field/id #uuid "50ab6af3-7838-5baf-b926-7d20ec2e1151" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186435822}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e9e20ff9-23b3-5457-a430-304f98c0d839" :question/math-academy-id "q-73950" :question/problem "Consider the vectors\n\n$$\n{a}_{1}=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix},\\,{a}_{2}=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix},\\,b=\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nIf ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b,$ then what is ${x}_{1}+{x}_{2}?$" :question/worked-solution "If ${x}_{1}{a}_{1}+{x}_{2}{a}_{2}=b$, then we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{1}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ 4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}+{x}_{2}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1} \\\\ 4{x}_{1} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 3{x}_{2} \\\\ -3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ \\begin{bmatrix}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2}\\end{bmatrix} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-11 \\\\ 8 \\\\ -14\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nEquating the corresponding components, we get the following system:\n\n$$\n\\left\\{\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} &=-11 \\\\ 4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} &=8 \\\\ 2{x}_{1}-3{x}_{2} &=-14\\end{aligned}\\right.\n$$\n\nAdding the second and the third equations we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}6{x}_{1} & =-6 \\\\ {x}_{1} & =-1,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich we substitute into the second equation to get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4{x}_{1}+3{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ 4(-1)+3{x}_{2} & =8 \\\\ 3{x}_{2} & =12 \\\\ {x}_{2} & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we substitute ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=4$ into the first equation to get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3{x}_{1}-2{x}_{2} & =-11 \\\\ 3(-1)-2(4) & =-11 \\\\ -11 & =-11,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhich gives a true statement. \n\nSo the solution of the system is ${x}_{1}=-1$ and ${x}_{2}=4,$ which means\n\n$$\n-{a}_{1}+4{a}_{2}=b.\n$$\n\nConsequently, \n\n$$\n{x}_{1}+{x}_{2}=-1+4=3.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Solving for Two Coefficients in a Linear Combination"}]}
